step("Verify: encrypts to expected Poly1305 tag")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
# Known-failing: impl tag diverges from canonical for 114-byte inputs.
# See doc/01_research/local/chacha_poly_tag_bug_2026-04-17.md
