### ChaCha20-Poly1305 RFC 8439 A.5 #5 (256-byte input, 4 ChaCha blocks)

#### output length is plaintext length + 16 (tag)

- Verify: output length is plaintext length + 16 (tag)
   - Expected: combined.len() equals `272u64`


